vices-head\">\n      <h2>The <em>menu</em>.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"service-list\">\n      <div class=\"service-row\">\n        <div class=\"no\">N\u00b0 01</div>\n        <h3>Customized Facial</h3>\n        <div class=\"desc\">A bespoke treatment tuned to your skin's unique needs \u2014 assessment, cleanse, exfoliation, mask, finishing care.</div>\n        <div class=\"price\">from $95</div>\n        <div class=\"arr\">\u2192</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-row\">\n        <div class=\"no\">N\u00b0 02</div>\n        <h3>Dermaplaning</h3>\n        <div class=\"desc\">Manual exfoliation that removes peach fuzz and dull skin \u2014 smoother texture, brighter glow.</div>\n        <div class=\"price\">from $80</div>\n        <div class=\"arr\">\u2192</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-row\">\n        <div class=\"no\">N\u00b0 03</div>\n        <h3>Brow Lamination</h3>\n        <div class=\"desc\">Lifted, fluffy, perfectly groomed brows that last weeks. Includes shape, tint optional.</div>\n        <div class=\"price\">from $75</div>\n        <div class=\"arr\">\u2192</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-row\">\n        <div class=\"no\">N\u00b0 04</div>\n        <h3>Lash Lift & Tint</h3>\n        <div class=\"desc\">A gentle curl and rich tint for your natural lashes \u2014 wake up ready, no extensions required.</div>\n        <div class=\"price\">from $90</div>\n        <div class=\"arr\">\u2192</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"service-row\">\n        <div class=\"no\">N\u00b0 05</div>\n        <h3>Body Waxing</h3>\n        <div class=\"desc\">Precision waxing \u2014 brows, lip, bikini, Brazilian, full body. Long-lasting and carefully done.</div>\n        <div class=\"price\">from $25</div>\n        <div class=\"arr\">\u2192</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>", "about": "<section class=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"about-inner\">\n      <div class=\"about-visual\">\n        <div class=\"main\"></div>\n